      "description": "Make the agent actually use tools and LLM in a real scenario. Ensure tool results flow back into the planner, LLM responses are stored in state, the planner can chain multiple steps, and the loop can run 5–20 cycles without stalling.",
      "details": "This is a full integration test of the Unified Agent Runtime. The goal is to have a working multi-step agent that: 1) Uses tools and receives results, 2) Uses LLM calls and stores responses, 3) Chains multiple decisions, 4) Reaches a FinalAnswer after several cycles.",
