          "status": "done",
          "title": "Verify no stalling and proper termination"
        }
      ],
      "testStrategy": "Run a full end-to-end test with a real multi-step scenario (e.g. search → calc → final answer). Verify state contains tool results and LLM responses, and the loop terminates cleanly.",
      "title": "End-to-end agent test: make the runtime loop execute a real multi-step plan using LLM + tools + final answer"
